---
title: "end (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller invokes end()
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: caller is not legionOperator and not projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is legionOperator or projectAdmin
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_already: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_check_canceled: hasEnded == false
    q_revert_already --> [*]: revert SaleAlreadyEnded
    q_check_canceled --> q_revert_canceled: isCanceled == true
    q_check_canceled --> q_set_end: isCanceled == false
    q_revert_canceled --> [*]: revert SaleCanceled
    q_set_end --> q_set_time: hasEnded = true
    q_set_time --> q_emit: endTime = block.timestamp
    q_emit --> [*]: emit SaleEnded(endTime)

    note right of q_set_end
        INV-001: hasEnded transitions from false to true exactly once
        INV-002: endTime is set to current block.timestamp on conclusion
        INV-003: After end(), no new investments can be processed
    end note
